#ASSERT `s55(2)(a) the name was enrolled on the day within the three months immediately before 26 January 1984` (Date 25 10 1983) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s55(2)(a) the name was enrolled on the day within the three months immediately before 26 January 1984` (Date 26 1 1984) EQUALS JUST FALSE
